        "**Slicing: Strings and Lists**\n",
        "⏰\n",
        "Python Basics for DS & AI 9\n",
        "• Slicing takes out a part of a string or list:\n",
        "name[start:stop]\n",
        "\n",
        "• start is included, stop is NOT included.\n",
        "\n",
        "• Leave start empty to begin from 0. Leave stop\n",
        "empty to go to the end.\n",
        "\n",
        "• A negative index counts from the end: -1 is\n",
        "the last item.\n",
        "\n",
        "• step can also be given:\n",
        "name[start:stop:step]"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "UrX1MP8xRzKD"
      }
