        "**Escape Sequences**\n",
        "\n",
        "Python Basics for DS & AI 10\n",
        "• A backslash \\ plus a character is an escape\n",
        "sequence.\n",
        "\n",
        "• It adds special characters inside a string, like\n",
        "a new line, a tab or quotes.\n",
        "\n",
        "• Each one counts as 1 character.\n",
        "\n",
        "• r\"...\" is a raw string: backslash stays as\n",
        "normal text.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "**Escape Meaning**\n",
        "\n",
        "\\n *New line*\n",
        "\n",
        "\\t *Tab (a gap)*\n",
        "\n",
        "\\\\ *Backslash*\n",
        "\n",
        "\\' *Single quote*\n",
        "\n",
        "\\\"* Double quote*\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dxvffcnWSurY"
      }
    },
